        "implementation": "cpp",
        "sourceFile": "SDO_READ_STRING.cpp",
        "documentation": "Reads a text object (VISIBLE_STRING) of up to 254 characters from a node by SDO into DATA. Handshake as SDO_READ4. NETWORK counts from 1; DEVICE is the node ID or its name; TIMEOUT T#0s uses the network SDO timeout.\nExample: read(ENABLE := start, DEVICE := IO_Module, INDEX := 16#1008, SUBINDEX := 0); IF read.CONFIRM THEN name := read.DATA; END_IF;"
      },
