        "sourceFile": "GET_LOCAL_NODE_ID.cpp",
        "documentation": "Gives the master's own node ID on the network, in the same call while ENABLE is TRUE. NETWORK counts from 1.\nExample: local(ENABLE := TRUE); id := local.NODEID;"
      },
